Category: IT Services

Location:

For an international organization in New York, we are urgently looking for a REMOTE Data Quality/ETL Specialist with MEAN stack framework experience. Candidates need to be fluent in English. All positions are long-term. This position is open for contractors and employees.

Candidates need to be able to work 4-6 hours per day in the normal office hours of New York, US.

Tasks and responsibilities:

• Work with an agile team to design and implement ETL (Extract, Transform, and Load) processes;

• Translate design specifications and functional requirements into ETL processes;

• Data import, transformation and loading to data lakehouse from MongoDB;

• Merge code into shared repositories, validate code, and perform quality assurance;

• Implement data quality measures to ensure accuracy of data loaded into data lakehouse;

Profile:

​

• +2 years of experience working with AWS ETL and data quality tools;

• Experience designing and implementing ETL pipeline;

• Experience with data cleansing and deduplication methods;

• Experience with MEAN stack framework;

• Experience with ensuring data accuracy and ETL testing;

• Experience with Kafka or other similar large-scale messaging technologies;

• Knowledge and understanding of SDLC and Agile/Scrum procedures, CI/CD and Automation;

• Fluent in English;

Offered:

• A challenging role for an international organization in New York;

• Attractive salary package;

